            alt=""
            width="34"
            height="34"
          />
        </h2>
        <p class="text-cool-gray-40 leading-relaxed">
          Easily upgrade or downgrade your plan as your community grows or
          shrinks. Scale your resources up and down as needed without losing
          your data.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl lg:text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 flex items-center">
          <span class="underline decoration-4 decoration-teal-50"
            >Transparent</span
          >
          <img
            src="/index/doodles/tree.svg"
            class="ml-2 transition duration-700 ease-out hover:scale-110"
            alt=""
            width="34"
            height="34"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </h2>
        <p class="text-cool-gray-40 leading-relaxed">
          Complete visibility into pricing, resource usage, and server
          performance. No hidden fees, no surprise charges - just honest,
          straightforward hosting with clear billing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="sm:col-span-2">
        <h2 class="text-xl lg:text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 flex items-center">
          <span class="underline decoration-4 decoration-purple-50"
            >Secured by off-site backups</span
          >
          <img
            src="/index/doodles/rain.svg"
            class="ml-2 transition duration-300 ease-out hover:translate-x-1 hover:-translate-y-1"
            alt=""
            width="34"
            height="34"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </h2>
        <p class="text-cool-gray-40 leading-relaxed">
          Schedule automatic backups or take your own backups manually. The key
          advantage: all backups are stored off-site, protecting your worlds
          even if our datacenter goes down. Your creations are always safe.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Testimonials Section -->
  <div class="mb-16 lg:mb-32" aria-label="Customer Testimonials">
    <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-semibold mb-12 text-center">
